<title>USA: Phamis says Q4 to be comparable or top Q3.</title>
<headline>Phamis says Q4 to be comparable or top Q3.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>PHAMIS Inc said on Thursday changes in its revenue mix and delays in customer installations impacted third quarter revenues and gross margins, but it expects fourth quarter results to be comparable with or exceed the results of the third quarter.</p>
<p>The company said it significantly cut the rate of growth in operating expenses.</p>
<p>The company reported third quarter net of $0.11 a share, down from  $0.17 a share. It also said it expects 1997 to be a record year for PHAMIS, said Sample.</p>
</text>
